e is a large ribonucleoprotein complex responsible for the synthesis of proteins in the cell."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}